{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Evil Rise</strong> is a terrifying new entry in survival horror, blending psychological dread, grotesque bio-horror, and immersive first-person gameplay in one intense experience.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858140/extras/489d875dce392eef39e97e8179a2a16d.poster.avif?t=1758330612\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858140/extras/489d875dce392eef39e97e8179a2a16d.webm?t=1758330612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858140/extras/489d875dce392eef39e97e8179a2a16d.mp4?t=1758330612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Liam Harper, who returns to his family\u2019s long-abandoned mansion\u2014now overrun by the horrifying results of Nexon-9, a bio-research experiment that twisted human lives into something monstrous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in modern-day rural America, <i>The Evil Rise</i> invites you to explore the decaying Harper estate, where every shadow hides a secret and every door could lead to your end. Confront relentless enemies, solve cryptic puzzles, and uncover the truth behind your family\u2019s dark legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858140/extras/f5c848ce651b6f62ec37871d451bc1dc.poster.avif?t=1758330612\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858140/extras/f5c848ce651b6f62ec37871d451bc1dc.webm?t=1758330612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858140/extras/f5c848ce651b6f62ec37871d451bc1dc.mp4?t=1758330612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Powered by Unreal Engine 5, every flicker of light, distant scream, and blood-stained hallway is rendered with chilling detail, drawing you deeper into a world where survival is never guaranteed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric, story-driven exploration of a decaying mansion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic survival against grotesque, fast-moving enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging puzzles woven into the narrative and environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning visuals and audio powered by Unreal Engine 5</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you survive the mansion's twisted legacy\u2026 or become part of it?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2858140?t=1758330612","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858140/96910ffc9dd9ceafaa226f8a9792a1f2b8acad0b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758330612","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858140/b2492a54ef3d3bad62d9bf32c9e016d709f669f7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758330612","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858140/b2492a54ef3d3bad62d9bf32c9e016d709f669f7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758330612","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Commentary available","id":14},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains intense violence, blood and gore, disturbing imagery, and themes of psychological horror. Players will confront grotesque, mutated creatures and experience moments of dread, fear, and tension throughout a dark, story-driven setting."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Evil Rise</strong> is a terrifying new entry in survival horror, blending psychological dread, grotesque bio-horror, and immersive first-person gameplay in one intense experience.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858140/extras/489d875dce392eef39e97e8179a2a16d.poster.avif?t=1758330612\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858140/extras/489d875dce392eef39e97e8179a2a16d.webm?t=1758330612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858140/extras/489d875dce392eef39e97e8179a2a16d.mp4?t=1758330612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Liam Harper, who returns to his family\u2019s long-abandoned mansion\u2014now overrun by the horrifying results of Nexon-9, a bio-research experiment that twisted human lives into something monstrous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in modern-day rural America, <i>The Evil Rise</i> invites you to explore the decaying Harper estate, where every shadow hides a secret and every door could lead to your end. Confront relentless enemies, solve cryptic puzzles, and uncover the truth behind your family\u2019s dark legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858140/extras/f5c848ce651b6f62ec37871d451bc1dc.poster.avif?t=1758330612\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858140/extras/f5c848ce651b6f62ec37871d451bc1dc.webm?t=1758330612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858140/extras/f5c848ce651b6f62ec37871d451bc1dc.mp4?t=1758330612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Powered by Unreal Engine 5, every flicker of light, distant scream, and blood-stained hallway is rendered with chilling detail, drawing you deeper into a world where survival is never guaranteed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric, story-driven exploration of a decaying mansion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic survival against grotesque, fast-moving enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging puzzles woven into the narrative and environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning visuals and audio powered by Unreal Engine 5</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you survive the mansion's twisted legacy\u2026 or become part of it?</p>","developers":["Liam Hadari"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858140/2f7d697df44cd20593bfa3e501e053c62a827eb4/header.jpg?t=1758330612","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Luminam Games. All Rights Reserved. The Evil Rise is a trademark of Luminam Games. All other trademarks, logos, and brand names are the property of their respective owners. Unauthorized copying, distribution, or modification of this game and its assets is strictly prohibited.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2858140/610046282/ade3635d66bf82c2508a860bba79e9fbdf642ffc/1750948106/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750256671","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.