ying, mutated creatures created by the deadly Nexon-9 experiment. Uncover dark secrets, confront his family's haunting legacy, and fight to escape in this immersive first-person survival horror.","steam_appid":2858140,"support_info":{"email":"support@luminamgames.com","url":"https://luminamgames.com/"},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":"https://luminamgames.com/"}